Music Recognition Web Client
============================
This project is a frontend for lewhfree/music-recognition-client-portable. It compiles the library to wasm, loads it, and then communicates with the server (lewhfree/music-recognition-backend).

Dependencies
============================
just
git
zig

Build
============================
Run 'just deps && just' to build the library. Then open/host index.html however you want.
